<title>SINGAPORE: SPC appoints new president.</title>
<headline>SPC appoints new president.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Petroleum Company Ltd (SPC) said on Monday it had appointed Jacobus Johannes Rinck, 60, as its executive president.</p>
<p>Rinck will have overall responsibility for the business activity of SPC and the group, a company statement said.</p>
<p>Prior to the appointment, Rinck was the general manager and chief executive officer of Singapore Refining Company Pte Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
